[Music]  hey everyone Mike McCarty here with 70  hours of Assassin's Creed Odyssey in the  bag Odyssey is largely based around its  progression and more specifically its  loot as such one of the joys of the game  is finding the best legendary gear to  outfit your mercenary with so without  further ado here are three of my  personal favorite legendary sets along  with an overview of where you'll find  them to help you through those tougher  late-game quests as a side note we're  avoiding story spoilers but if you don't  want to see any of the gear before you  pick it up obviously don't watch this  video first off is the Spartan war hero  armor this one is pretty straightforward  with all five pieces equipped Cassandra  or Alexios will get a 15% damage boost  with their warrior abilities these  include the bulrush shield breaker your  over power attacks and of course the  infamous Sparta kick  all-in-all this set is great for open  combat to get this set you'll have to  kill every one of the cultists in the  peloponnesian league branch for spoiler  purposes we won't show the cultists tree  here but you'll come across several of  the members throughout the main  storyline and outside of that just  follow the clues next up is the pirate  armor this loadout will mainly benefit a  stealthy approach and because of this  it's one of my favourite legendaries in  the game it gives you a 15% damage  increase to every assassin ability this  includes basic assassinations with your  broken spear critical assassinations the  teleportation rush assassination and the  debilitating hero strike ability which  if you're not using you should try it  out if your broken spear is your weapon  of choice and you prefer to stay silent  whenever possible this set should  definitely be a go-to you learn these  five pieces by killing each cultists in  the gods of the Aegean Sea branch almost  all of these will be found on the open  ocean as pirates themselves so make sure  you're putting the resources into the  necessary upgrades with your ship via  trusty ax in order to take them down  third but definitely not least is the  Amazon set  this is one of the more useful  Legendary's in the game as it refills  your health bar by doing any type of  damage from archery abilities to basic  dagger at them as long as you get enough  attacks in and make the effort to stay  on the offensive the Amazon Set will let  you take down enemies three or in a few  of my cases four levels above your  mercenary this could help you take down  cult members or clear a high-level  athenian fort to get the full set just  kill every cultist in the heroes of the  cult branch so there you have it our  three favorite legendary armor sets from  assassin's creed Odyssey these aren't  the only ones of course there are about  a dozen more each with their own  abilities and buffs and aesthetic values  make sure to let us know your favorites  and you can go over to GameSpot to see a  longer gallery that covers more of the  legendary sets in the meantime stay  tuned to game spot because we'll be  covering Assassin's Creed Odyssey in the  coming weeks  [Music]

